<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Although all four models performed well, Logistic Regression was selected for deployment due to its strong balance of recall, transparency and business applicability. While Random Forest achieved the highest ROC-AUC \(0.9298\), Logistic Regression offered perfect recall \(1.00\) for churners, which is critical for minimizing false negatives and enabling timely retention efforts.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Its interpretability also makes it easier to communicate insights to business stakeholders and integrate into operational workflows. While ensemble models like XGBoost and LightGBM had similar accuracy, their complexity limits transparency and real-time use.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
